              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Are omukhono khumurwe kweshihaanwashie, nashiirila hamuliango weliheema liokhwakaana; nabo abakuhani abaana baHaruni boohe amalasile khushimalilo tsimbeka tsiosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
