              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khumusango okwo, omusango kwokhwishia, aleerele OMWAMI eshihaanwa eshikholelwa omulilo; mbu amasinya akafuunikha amala, namasinya kosi akali khumala ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
